### logs.md

```markdown
# Logs — [workspace]

## How to Access Logs

| Service | Log Location | Tool | Query Pattern |
|---------|-------------|------|---------------|
| api-service | CloudWatch: `/aws/ecs/api-service` | AWS Console / awslogs | `filter @message like /ERROR/` |
| worker | Datadog | Datadog UI | `service:worker status:error` |

## Common Queries

### Find errors in the last hour
```bash
aws logs filter-log-events \
  --log-group-name /aws/ecs/api-service \
  --start-time $(date -d '1 hour ago' +%s000) \
  --filter-pattern ERROR
\```

### Tail logs locally
```bash
# [add local log tailing command here]
\```

## Alerting
[Where alerts go — PagerDuty, Slack channel, etc.]
```

