## When User Explicitly Tells You Something

If the user says things like:
> "lu note: the orders queue ARN is arn:aws:sqs:us-east-1:123456789:orders-queue"
> "lu save this: logs are in Datadog under service:checkout"
> "lu the prod DB is at db.prod.internal"

Write it immediately to the correct doc without asking. Confirm in one line.

